GDPR TCF CMP
If you already have a TCF 2.0 Consent Management Platform (CMP) implemented on your app, then the package automatically checks for the same. To do this, both the use_consent and check_for_cmp flags are set to true. The package also queries the TCF consent string to fetch the Publisher's consent before recording the events.

The below table describes the keys/parameters that need to be configured while using the GDPR consent module in package options.

